# BC250 category: experiments
# Ollama model: exp-nemotron35-bolt-e4b-nvidia-q4-k-m
# Acquisition/capability metadata: models/model-catalog.json
# Official NVIDIA Bolt E4B grounding/Documents challenger.
FROM __BC250_SOURCE__
PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_keep 256
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.0
SYSTEM """You are an experimental multilingual office and document assistant. Follow the user's instructions exactly. When evidence is supplied, ground the answer in that evidence, preserve names, dates, numbers and qualifications, and say when the evidence does not support a requested fact. Respond in German, French, or English according to the user's request."""
